{"SystemName":"Customer.EmailTokenValidationMessage","Title":"{{Store.Name}} - E-posta Do\u011Frulama Kodu","Content":"\u003Chtml\u003E\u003Chead\u003E\u003Cmeta charset=\u0022utf-8\u0022\u003E\u003Cmeta name=\u0022viewport\u0022 content=\u0022width=device-width, initial-scale=1\u0022\u003E\u003Cstyle\u003Ebody{font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;line-height:1.6;color:#333;margin:0;padding:0;background-color:#f9f9f9}.email-container{max-width:600px;margin:0 auto;background-color:#ffffff;padding:20px;border-radius:5px;box-shadow:0 0 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.1)}.header{text-align:center;padding:20px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #eee}.content{padding:20px 0}.verification-code{background-color:#f5f5f5;border-radius:4px;padding:15px;margin:20px 0;text-align:center;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:5px}.footer{text-align:center;padding-top:20px;border-top:1px solid #eee;font-size:12px;color:#777}@media only screen and (max-width:480px){.email-container{width:100% !important;}.content{padding:10px !important;}}\u003C/style\u003E\u003C/head\u003E\u003Cbody\u003E\u003Cdiv class=\u0022email-container\u0022\u003E\u003Cdiv class=\u0022header\u0022\u003E\u003Ch2\u003EE-posta Do\u011Frulama\u003C/h2\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\u003Cdiv class=\u0022content\u0022\u003E\u003Cp\u003EMerhaba {{Customer.FullName}},\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003EKimli\u011Finizi do\u011Frulamak i\u00E7in l\u00FCtfen a\u015Fa\u011F\u0131daki 6 haneli kodu giri\u015F sayfas\u0131na giriniz:\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cdiv class=\u0022verification-code\u0022\u003E\u003Cb\u003E{{Customer.Token}}\u003C/b\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\u003Cp\u003EBu kodu istemediyseniz, l\u00FCtfen bu e-postay\u0131 dikkate almay\u0131n\u0131z.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003EG\u00FCvenli al\u0131\u015Fveri\u015Fler dileriz,\u003Cbr\u003E{{Store.Name}} Ekibi\u003C/p\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\u003Cdiv class=\u0022footer\u0022\u003E\u003Cp\u003EBu e-posta, hesap g\u00FCvenli\u011Finiz i\u00E7in otomatik olarak g\u00F6nderilmi\u015Ftir.\u003C/p\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\u003C/div